        <br />
        <h2>Broker Support</h2>
        <p>
          You can use OnlyTrades to automate trading on any broker that has a
          cTrader backend.
        </p>
        <p>Most brokers offer cTrader, some examples;</p>
        <ul>
          <li>IC Markets</li>
          <li>Pepperstone</li>
          <li>FxPro</li>
          <li>FP Markets</li>
          <li>BlackBull Markets</li>
          <li>Skilling</li>
          <li>RoboForex</li>
          <li>Fusion Markets</li>
          <li>Tradeview Markets</li>
          <li>Axi</li>
          <li>GO Markets</li>
        </ul>
        <p>And many more</p>

        <br />
        <h2>How It Works</h2>

        <h3>Rest API</h3>

        <p>
          OnlyTrades provides a REST API to execute trades, on both demo
          and live accounts.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can write your own trading algorithms and use this REST API to
          execute the trades automatically.
        </p>
        <br />

        <h3>TradingView</h3>

        <p>
          Using the REST API, you can send alerts from your TradingView strategies
          to trigger trades automatically.
        </p>
        <br />

        <h3>Hosted Bots</h3>
        <p>
          OnlyTrades provides a hosted bot engine that allows you to host your
          trading algorithms and execute them on our platform
        </p>
        <p>Hosted bots will enjoy the lowest execution latency</p>
        <p>Our hosted bots support;</p>
        <ul>
          <li>JavaScript / TypeScript</li>
          <li>Rust (coming soon)</li>
          <li>C/C++ (coming soon)</li>
          <li>Python (coming soon)</li>
          <li>Any language that can consume dynamic libraries (.dll/.so)</li>
        </ul>
        <br />

        <h3>AI Enhanced Bots <span>Coming Soon</span></h3>
        <p>
          Hosted bots can be run on GPU accelerated hardware,
          allowing them to leverage AI to enhance trading decisions
        </p>
        <p>
          High performance CPU hardware is also available for bots
          that use CPU inference
        </p>
        <p>
          Bots can also call out to third party APIs for external decisioning engines
        </p>
        <br />
        
        <h3>Market Place <span>Coming Soon</span></h3>
        <p>
          For traders that want a no-code solution, OnlyTrades provides a market
          place where traders can leverage bots written by other traders.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can evaluate marketplace statistics and leaderboards to see which
          bots are performing the best.
        </p>
        <p>
          For bot authors, the OnlyTrades marketplace allows you to publish your
          bots and earn income from their usage.
        </p>
        <br />

        <h2>About The Author</h2>
        <p>
          OnlyTrades is developed by David Alsh. An engineer with decades of experience 
          in software development, and a passion for trading and AI.
        </p>

        <p>
          OnlyTrades was originally a personal tool developed to help automate
          trading strategies. I decided to grow it into a platform that can help
          others enter the world of trade automation.
        </p>

        <p>
          The service is written in Rust, is highly reliable, high performance,
          and that allows it to be a more affordable option than what is available
          from traditional trading platforms.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alshdavid">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/alshdavid">GitHub</a></p>
      </section>
